      ],
      "title": "epan: Allow 0 length in tvb_new_octet_aligned",
      "message": "epan: Allow 0 length in tvb_new_octet_aligned\n\nMove the DISSECTOR_ASSERT up so that any negative value of bits\nbelow -1 isn't allowed. Then allow zero bits to be a zero-length\nTVB. (Not incredibly useful, but might fall out of a programmatic\nlength.)\n\nWe probably want to change no_of_bits to be unsigned at some point,\nand have a _remaining variant for aligning the entire TVB. (There\ndoesn't appear to be any uses of aligning the entire TVB currently,\npossibly because it's undocumented in the header that -1 works.)\n(#20103)\n",
